WEBVTT

00:02.438 --> 00:03.814
Water...

00:04.857 --> 00:06.149
Earth...

00:06.818 --> 00:08.193
Fire...

00:08.945 --> 00:10.320
Air...

00:11.197 --> 00:14.574
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.285 --> 00:18.704
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.664 --> 00:20.872
Only the avatar,

00:20.957 --> 00:22.332
master of all four elements,

00:22.417 --> 00:23.500
could stop them.

00:23.584 --> 00:25.294
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.378 --> 00:26.795
he vanished.

00:27.297 --> 00:29.339
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I

00:29.424 --> 00:30.966
discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.050 --> 00:32.718
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.178
And although his airbending
skills were great,

00:35.263 --> 00:36.346
he has a lot to learn before

00:36.431 --> 00:38.265
he's ready to save anyone.

00:39.100 --> 00:42.227
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:08.796 --> 01:11.256
Those clouds
look so soft, don't they?

01:11.466 --> 01:13.175
Like you could just jump down

01:13.259 --> 01:15.677
and you'd land in a big, soft,
cottony heap.

01:15.762 --> 01:17.220
Maybe you should give it a try.

01:17.305 --> 01:18.513
You're hilarious.

01:18.765 --> 01:20.098
I'll try it!

01:20.183 --> 01:21.433
Ha ha ha!

01:23.269 --> 01:25.354
Yeah!

01:30.651 --> 01:32.361
Turns out, clouds are made of water.

01:37.658 --> 01:39.534
Hey, what is that?

01:44.165 --> 01:45.665
It's like a scar.

01:49.879 --> 01:51.254
Listen.

01:51.756 --> 01:53.715
It's so quiet.

01:53.800 --> 01:55.425
There's no life anywhere.

01:55.510 --> 01:57.177
Aang, are you ok?

01:58.179 --> 01:59.221
Fire Nation!

01:59.305 --> 02:01.098
Those evil savages make me sick.

02:01.182 --> 02:02.182
They have no respect for--

02:02.266 --> 02:03.517
Shh.

02:03.601 --> 02:05.435
What, I'm not allowed to be angry?

02:10.691 --> 02:12.442
Why would anyone do this?

02:12.652 --> 02:14.486
How could I let this happen?

02:14.570 --> 02:16.822
Aang, you didn't let this happen.

02:17.031 --> 02:18.490
It has nothing to do with you.

02:18.699 --> 02:20.325
Yes, it does.

02:20.410 --> 02:22.661
It's the avatar's job
to protect nature,

02:22.995 --> 02:24.704
but I don't know how to do my job.

02:24.789 --> 02:26.623
That's why we're going
to the North Pole--

02:26.707 --> 02:28.208
To find you a teacher.

02:28.459 --> 02:30.544
Yeah. A waterbending teacher.

02:30.628 --> 02:33.338
But there's no one who can
teach me how to be the Avatar.

02:33.423 --> 02:36.091
Monk Gyatso said
that Avatar Roku would help me.

02:36.300 --> 02:38.051
The Avatar before you?

02:38.261 --> 02:39.594
He died over a hundred years ago.

02:39.679 --> 02:41.138
How are you supposed to talk to him?

02:41.639 --> 02:43.515
I don't know.

02:48.062 --> 02:49.646
Uncle, it's time to leave.

02:49.730 --> 02:52.441
Where are you? Uncle Iroh!

02:52.525 --> 02:53.942
Over here.

02:54.026 --> 02:55.110
Uncle?

02:55.695 --> 02:56.736
We need to move on.

02:56.821 --> 02:58.613
We're closing in
on the Avatar's trail,

02:58.698 --> 03:00.615
and I don't want to lose him.

03:01.075 --> 03:03.618
You look tired, Prince Zuko.

03:03.828 --> 03:07.038
Why don't you join me
in these hot springs

03:07.123 --> 03:09.833
and soak away your troubles?

03:10.042 --> 03:12.210
My troubles cannot be soaked away.

03:12.295 --> 03:13.628
It's time to go!

03:13.963 --> 03:16.339
You should take your teacher's advice

03:16.424 --> 03:18.425
and relax a little.

03:18.509 --> 03:21.553
The temperature's just right.

03:22.013 --> 03:24.222
I heated it myself.

03:27.101 --> 03:29.394
Enough. We need to leave now.

03:29.479 --> 03:30.479
Get out of the water!

03:30.855 --> 03:32.189
Very well.

03:32.273 --> 03:33.315
On second thought,

03:33.399 --> 03:35.233
why don't you take
another few minutes?

03:35.443 --> 03:37.110
But be back at the ship
in half an hour,

03:37.195 --> 03:38.445
or I'm leaving without you.

03:42.742 --> 03:43.783
Hey, Aang.

03:43.868 --> 03:44.993
Are you ready to be cheered up?

03:45.328 --> 03:46.328
No.

03:48.706 --> 03:50.499
Hey, how is that cheering me up?

03:52.043 --> 03:53.043
Cheered me up.

03:54.212 --> 03:56.129
Yeah, I probably deserved that.

03:57.089 --> 03:59.382
These acorns are everywhere, Aang.

04:00.384 --> 04:02.552
That means the forest will grow back.

04:02.637 --> 04:05.263
Every one of these will be
a tall oak tree someday,

04:05.348 --> 04:06.681
and all the birds and animals

04:06.766 --> 04:08.099
that lived here will come back.

04:11.145 --> 04:12.312
Thanks, Katara.

04:15.608 --> 04:17.400
Hey, who are you?

04:17.610 --> 04:19.569
When I saw the flying bison,

04:19.862 --> 04:21.613
I thought it was impossible,

04:21.822 --> 04:23.907
but those markings...

04:24.200 --> 04:26.785
Are you the Avatar, child?

04:29.580 --> 04:31.998
My village
desperately needs your help.

04:45.805 --> 04:49.474
This young person is the Avatar.

04:49.559 --> 04:52.602
So the rumors of your return are true.

04:52.895 --> 04:54.771
It is the greatest honor of a lifetime

04:54.855 --> 04:56.439
to be in your presence.

04:56.649 --> 04:58.066
Nice to meet you, too.

05:00.319 --> 05:02.821
So, is there something
I can help you with?

05:02.905 --> 05:04.864
I'm not sure.

05:05.324 --> 05:06.825
Our village is in crisis.

05:06.909 --> 05:08.827
He's our only hope.

05:09.453 --> 05:11.871
For the last few days at sunset,

05:12.081 --> 05:15.250
a spirit monster comes
and attacks our village.

05:15.835 --> 05:17.502
He is Hei Bai,

05:17.587 --> 05:19.754
the black and white spirit.

05:20.089 --> 05:21.381
Why is it attacking you?

05:21.757 --> 05:23.174
We do not know.

05:23.551 --> 05:25.135
But each of the last three nights,

05:25.219 --> 05:27.012
he has abducted one of our own.

05:27.096 --> 05:28.680
We are especially fearful

05:28.764 --> 05:30.599
because the winter solstice
draws near.

05:30.808 --> 05:32.350
What happens then?

05:32.435 --> 05:34.352
As the solstice approaches,

05:34.687 --> 05:36.980
the natural world and the spirit world

05:37.064 --> 05:39.024
grow closer and closer,

05:39.233 --> 05:40.609
until the line between them

05:40.693 --> 05:42.611
is blurred completely.

05:43.446 --> 05:46.781
Hei Bai is already causing
devastation and destruction.

05:46.866 --> 05:48.617
Once the solstice is here,

05:48.701 --> 05:51.036
there is no telling what will happen.

05:51.370 --> 05:53.705
So what do you want me to do exactly?

05:53.914 --> 05:55.665
Who better to resolve a crisis

05:55.750 --> 05:58.543
between our world and the spirit world

05:58.628 --> 06:00.879
than the Avatar himself?

06:01.088 --> 06:02.631
You are the great bridge

06:02.840 --> 06:04.758
between man and spirits.

06:04.967 --> 06:07.385
Right. That's me.

06:07.637 --> 06:09.220
Hey, great bridge guy.

06:09.305 --> 06:10.930
Can I talk to you over here
for a second?

06:12.975 --> 06:15.894
Aang, you seem a little
unsure about all this.

06:16.187 --> 06:18.438
Yeah. That might be because
I don't know anything at all

06:18.522 --> 06:19.689
about the spirit world.

06:21.567 --> 06:23.818
It's not like there's someone
to teach me this stuff.

06:24.195 --> 06:26.321
So, can you help these people?

06:26.405 --> 06:28.198
I have to try, don't I?

06:29.033 --> 06:30.742
Maybe whatever I have to do
will just...

06:30.826 --> 06:31.826
Come to me.

06:33.746 --> 06:35.747
I think you can do it, Aang.

06:36.916 --> 06:38.249
Yeah.

06:38.334 --> 06:40.543
We're all gonna get eaten
by a spirit monster.

06:50.638 --> 06:51.721
Who's there?

06:53.641 --> 06:55.350
A meadow vole.

06:55.768 --> 06:57.727
I should have known.

06:57.812 --> 07:00.021
You startled me, little one.

07:02.441 --> 07:06.152
Seems I dozed off and missed
my nephew's deadline,

07:06.237 --> 07:08.947
but it was a very sweet nap.

07:21.544 --> 07:23.420
He's a Fire Nation soldier.

07:23.504 --> 07:25.255
He's no ordinary soldier.

07:25.339 --> 07:27.298
This is the Fire Lord's brother.

07:27.383 --> 07:28.800
The Dragon of the West--

07:28.884 --> 07:31.636
The once great General Iroh.

07:31.929 --> 07:33.930
But now, he's our prisoner.

07:46.318 --> 07:49.237
Hello? Spirit? Can you hear me?

07:49.321 --> 07:51.656
This is the Avatar speaking.

07:51.741 --> 07:54.409
I'm here to try to help stuff.

07:54.577 --> 07:55.910
This isn't right.

07:55.995 --> 07:57.746
We can't sit here and cower while Aang

07:57.830 --> 07:59.456
waits for some monster to show up.

07:59.749 --> 08:02.083
If anyone can save us, he can.

08:02.376 --> 08:04.836
He still shouldn't have to
face this alone.

08:11.177 --> 08:12.177
The sun is set.

08:12.261 --> 08:14.053
Where are you, Hei Bai?

08:15.139 --> 08:17.807
Well, spirit,

08:17.933 --> 08:19.392
I hereby ask you

08:19.477 --> 08:21.186
to please leave this village in peace.

08:25.107 --> 08:29.819
Ok. Well, I guess
that's settled, then.

08:49.465 --> 08:53.092
You must be the Hei Bai spirit.
My name is--

08:58.641 --> 09:00.475
My name is Aang. I'm the avatar,

09:00.559 --> 09:01.935
and I would like to help.

09:02.019 --> 09:03.102
Hey, wait up!

09:16.742 --> 09:19.077
The avatar's methods are...

09:19.161 --> 09:20.411
Unusual.

09:20.496 --> 09:21.579
It doesn't seem too interested

09:21.664 --> 09:22.872
in what he's saying.

09:22.957 --> 09:24.207
Maybe we should go help him.

09:24.291 --> 09:28.253
No. Only the Avatar
stands a chance against the Hei Bai.

09:28.754 --> 09:31.464
Aang will figure out
the right thing to do, Sokka.

09:34.677 --> 09:37.595
Please, would you stop
destroying things and listen?

09:38.180 --> 09:40.557
I'm just trying to do my job
as spirit bridge.

09:41.058 --> 09:42.267
Excuse me.

09:42.351 --> 09:44.102
Would you please turn around?

09:44.895 --> 09:47.146
I command you to turn around now!

09:52.236 --> 09:53.862
That's it. He needs help.

09:53.946 --> 09:55.029
Sokka! Wait!

09:56.782 --> 09:57.907
It's not safe.

09:58.534 --> 10:00.201
Hei Bai. Over here!

10:04.415 --> 10:05.915
Sokka! Go back!

10:06.000 --> 10:07.625
We'll fight him together, Aang.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.919
I don't want to fight him unless I--

10:16.051 --> 10:17.176
Sokka!

10:24.268 --> 10:25.310
Uncle.

10:25.519 --> 10:27.145
Uncle, where are you?

10:27.229 --> 10:29.272
Sir, maybe he thought
you left without him.

10:29.356 --> 10:31.232
Something's not right here.

10:31.775 --> 10:32.942
That pile of rocks.

10:33.652 --> 10:36.195
It looks like
there's been a landslide, sir.

10:36.280 --> 10:38.156
Land doesn't slide uphill.

10:38.240 --> 10:40.658
Those rocks didn't move naturally.

10:41.201 --> 10:43.328
My uncle's been captured
by earthbenders.

10:54.423 --> 10:56.549
Aang! Over here!

11:03.682 --> 11:04.682
Help!

11:04.975 --> 11:06.142
Hang on, Sokka!

11:13.817 --> 11:15.234
Aah!

11:24.536 --> 11:25.536
Sokka!

11:28.457 --> 11:29.832
I've failed.

11:44.014 --> 11:45.974
Where are you taking me?

11:46.058 --> 11:47.850
We're taking you to face justice.

11:47.935 --> 11:48.977
Right.

11:49.395 --> 11:51.562
But where, specifically?

11:51.647 --> 11:54.315
A place you're quite
familiar with, actually.

11:54.400 --> 11:58.361
You once laid siege
to it for 600 days,

11:58.445 --> 12:00.446
but it would not yield to you.

12:00.531 --> 12:04.450
The great city of Ba Sing Se.

12:05.035 --> 12:07.286
It was greater than
you were, apparently.

12:07.371 --> 12:11.207
I acknowledge my defeat at Ba Sing Se.

12:11.291 --> 12:14.293
After 600 days away from home,

12:14.378 --> 12:18.339
my men were tired, and I was tired.

12:21.301 --> 12:23.428
And I'm still tired.

12:44.116 --> 12:45.700
I'm sure they'll be back.

12:45.784 --> 12:46.784
I know.

12:49.663 --> 12:51.706
You should get some rest.

12:51.790 --> 12:53.082
Everything's gonna be ok.

12:55.127 --> 12:57.503
Your brother is in good hands.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.047
I would be shocked

12:59.131 --> 13:01.507
if the Avatar returned without him.

13:02.009 --> 13:04.927
Katara? Katara, I lost him.

13:07.806 --> 13:09.474
The sun is rising.

13:10.350 --> 13:12.769
Perhaps he will return soon.

13:12.853 --> 13:14.687
What? No. I'm right here.

13:14.772 --> 13:15.772
Grr!

13:23.739 --> 13:25.656
I'm in the spirit world.

13:33.832 --> 13:36.584
Yep, that's Uncle Iroh.

13:40.798 --> 13:43.091
I'll figure this out, Katara.
I promise.

13:43.509 --> 13:45.009
Like they said, I'm the bridge

13:45.094 --> 13:46.844
between the worlds, right?

13:46.929 --> 13:49.764
All I have to do
is figure out what I have to do,

13:50.140 --> 13:51.599
but once I do that, no problem.

13:54.228 --> 13:55.895
Appa. Hey, buddy. I'm right here.

13:58.232 --> 14:00.483
But I guess you can't see me, either.

14:02.653 --> 14:04.403
It's ok, Appa. Don't worry.

14:04.822 --> 14:06.405
I'm sure they're on their way back.

14:06.490 --> 14:08.908
I bet they even found you
a bunch of moon peaches,

14:08.992 --> 14:10.076
for a treat.

14:12.538 --> 14:14.330
What am I supposed to do?

14:15.040 --> 14:17.458
Avatar Roku, how can I talk to you?

14:20.003 --> 14:21.003
Sokka?

14:27.511 --> 14:29.595
That's definitely not Sokka.

14:38.939 --> 14:40.314
What?

14:40.649 --> 14:42.900
I can't airbend in the spirit world.

14:58.584 --> 15:00.626
You don't know where Sokka is, do you?

15:11.138 --> 15:13.764
You're Avatar Roku's animal guide,

15:13.849 --> 15:15.516
like Appa is to me.

15:15.601 --> 15:17.977
I need to save my friend,
and I don't know how.

15:18.061 --> 15:20.271
Is there some way for me
to talk to Roku?

15:25.235 --> 15:26.736
I'll be back, Katara.

15:28.322 --> 15:29.697
Take me to Roku.

15:46.506 --> 15:47.715
What's the problem?

15:48.425 --> 15:49.425
Nothing.

15:50.135 --> 15:53.804
Actually, there is a bit of a problem.

15:53.889 --> 15:56.974
My old joints
are feeling sore and achy,

15:57.059 --> 15:59.518
and these shackles are too loose.

15:59.603 --> 16:00.853
Too loose?

16:01.188 --> 16:03.189
That's right. The cuffs are loose,

16:03.273 --> 16:06.234
and they jangle around
and bump my wrists.

16:06.318 --> 16:08.861
It would help me
if you would tighten them

16:08.946 --> 16:11.364
so they wouldn't shake around so much.

16:11.698 --> 16:12.823
Very well.

16:12.908 --> 16:14.909
Corporal, tighten
the prisoner's handcuffs.

16:21.250 --> 16:28.714
Aah!

16:42.646 --> 16:44.063
Hey! What are you doing?!

16:44.147 --> 16:46.023
Aah!

16:52.030 --> 16:53.572
I don't understand.

16:53.657 --> 16:55.324
This is just a statue of Roku.

17:05.085 --> 17:07.503
Is that what Roku
wants to talk to me about?

17:07.587 --> 17:08.838
A comet?

17:09.756 --> 17:10.756
When can I talk to him?

17:38.910 --> 17:40.328
It's a calendar,

17:40.412 --> 17:42.705
and the light will reach Roku
on the solstice.

17:43.665 --> 17:45.750
So that's when I'll be able
to speak to Roku?

17:47.794 --> 17:49.378
But I can't wait that long.

17:49.463 --> 17:51.255
I need to save Sokka now!

17:56.803 --> 17:57.803
Hyah!

18:05.103 --> 18:07.688
He is too dangerous, captain.

18:07.773 --> 18:09.523
We can't just carry him
to the capital.

18:09.608 --> 18:11.192
We have to do something now.

18:11.276 --> 18:12.610
I agree.

18:12.694 --> 18:13.819
He must be dealt with immediately

18:13.904 --> 18:15.780
and severely.

18:15.864 --> 18:16.906
Ptoh!

18:19.618 --> 18:21.994
It's no use, Appa.
I don't see them anywhere.

18:22.746 --> 18:25.289
Our best hope is to go back
to the village and wait.

18:33.048 --> 18:34.340
The Avatar.

18:47.187 --> 18:48.521
Whoa.

18:49.272 --> 18:50.272
Aah!

19:18.885 --> 19:20.177
You're back!

19:21.763 --> 19:23.139
Where's Sokka?

19:24.391 --> 19:25.391
I'm not sure.

19:31.022 --> 19:33.482
These dangerous hands
must be crushed.

19:39.322 --> 19:43.701
Hyah!

19:44.244 --> 19:46.245
Excellent form, Prince Zuko.

19:46.580 --> 19:47.788
You taught me well.

19:48.123 --> 19:49.665
Surrender yourselves.

19:49.749 --> 19:51.041
It's five against two.

19:51.126 --> 19:52.918
You're clearly outnumbered.

19:53.003 --> 19:54.962
That's true,

19:55.046 --> 19:57.840
but you are clearly outmatched.

19:58.258 --> 19:59.842
Hy...!

19:59.926 --> 20:01.010
Yah! Yah!

20:03.430 --> 20:04.680
Hyah! Hyah!

20:09.728 --> 20:10.728
Hyah!

20:22.365 --> 20:23.365
Yah!

20:34.419 --> 20:36.712
Now, would you please
put on some clothes?

20:58.527 --> 20:59.818
Aah!

20:59.903 --> 21:01.320
Aang! What are you doing?!

21:01.404 --> 21:02.863
Run!

21:20.048 --> 21:22.049
You're the spirit of this forest.

21:22.133 --> 21:23.842
Now I understand.

21:24.219 --> 21:25.553
You're upset and angry

21:25.637 --> 21:27.179
because your home was burned down.

21:28.014 --> 21:29.765
When I saw the forest had burned,

21:29.849 --> 21:30.975
I was sad and upset,

21:31.059 --> 21:32.685
but my friend gave me hope

21:32.769 --> 21:33.978
that the forest would grow back.

21:54.457 --> 21:55.457
Sokka!

21:57.335 --> 21:58.335
What happened?

21:58.420 --> 22:01.463
You were trapped in the spirit world
for 24 hours.

22:01.548 --> 22:02.798
How are you feeling?

22:02.882 --> 22:04.592
Like I seriously need
to use the bathroom.

22:07.095 --> 22:08.846
Thank you, Avatar.

22:08.930 --> 22:10.431
If only there were a way

22:10.515 --> 22:12.016
to repay you for what you've done.

22:12.350 --> 22:14.935
You could give us
some supplies and some money.

22:15.145 --> 22:16.353
-Sokka.
-What?

22:16.438 --> 22:17.730
We need stuff.

22:18.607 --> 22:22.109
It would be an honor
to help you prepare for your journey.

22:22.444 --> 22:24.320
I'm so proud of you, Aang.

22:24.404 --> 22:26.614
You figured out what to do
all on your own.

22:26.823 --> 22:29.283
Actually, I did have a little help.

22:29.492 --> 22:30.784
And there's something else.

22:34.748 --> 22:35.748
What is it?

22:35.832 --> 22:37.041
I need to talk to Roku,

22:37.125 --> 22:38.375
and I think I found a way

22:38.460 --> 22:39.793
to contact his spirit.

22:39.878 --> 22:42.504
-That's great.
-Creepy, but great.

22:42.589 --> 22:44.965
There's a temple
on a crescent-shaped island,

22:45.050 --> 22:46.634
and if I go there on the solstice,

22:46.718 --> 22:48.260
I'll be able to speak with him.

22:48.720 --> 22:50.804
But the solstice is tomorrow.

22:50.889 --> 22:53.015
Yeah, and there's one more problem.

22:53.099 --> 22:54.892
The island is in the Fire Nation.
